5. A web server is software that delivers web pages to users over the internet when requested through a browser.

Examples
Apache HTTP Server
Nginx
Microsoft IIS
Node.js Express
LiteSpeed
Example: When you open www.google.com, Google’s web servers deliver the web page to your browser.

